// SCRIPT VERSION
global string $g_msExportUI_VERSION;
$g_msExportUI_VERSION = "1.4.0.2.2";

source "msExport.mel";
print ( "msExportUI.mel version: "+$g_msExportUI_VERSION+"\n" );

// Automatically build the menu
msExportUI_menuBuild();

/* Changes

1.4.0.2.1 changes 
added a condition to allow batch exporting by network controllers, and the simpleExport scripts
-zd
1.4.0.2.2 changes 
Maya 2011 has differnt line spacing formating for the UI fonts.  Because of this, the hardcoded frame sizes originally coded for previous versions of Maya
were too small, and the UI printout was running out of room.  I've enlarged the frame windows to accomidate all versions of Maya now.
-zd

*/

